    "body": "Since Cython 3.2.6 #7723, shared module build uses a virtual pyx file. Generating annotations for this file caused builds to fail because the annotation code requires the physical file to exist.\r\n\r\nThis change disables annotations during the shared module build, mirroring the existing option set and restore pattern already used for cimport_from_pyx. Fixes #7910.",
